Builds a Bitwarden JSON export, imports in one shot.

Usage:
  1. Drop VW master pw into /home/lumen/secrets/.vw_master_pw (0600)
  2. Run: python3 /home/lumen/bin/vw-migrate-secrets
  3. After: shred -u /home/lumen/secrets/.vw_master_pw
"""
